<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust sets warrants on Hutchison.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on Hutchison.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said on Tuesday it has launched 60 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$56.7625     PREMIUM	 13.95 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.132	 GEARING	 5.28x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  28.JAN.98	PAYDATE	 24.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$59.75</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
